      {
        "dom_id": "question-222090",
        "name": "Question 3",
        "problem": "What are the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola $y=-4{x}^{2}-20x-15?$\n\nThe coordinates of the vertex are\n$($\n{{field-1}}\n,\n{{field-2}}\n$).$",
        "worked_solution": "The parabola's vertex lies on the symmetry axis, so we will start by computing the axis of symmetry. \n\nThe equation of the axis of symmetry of the parabola $y=a{x}^{2}+bx+c$ is given by\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{b}{2a}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=-4$ and $b=-20$ into the formula for the axis of symmetry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-\\frac{(-20)}{2(-4)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(-20)}{(-8)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the axis of symmetry is $x=-\\frac{5}{2}.$ This also represents the $x$-coordinate of the vertex. To find the $y$-coordinate of the vertex, we substitute $x=-\\frac{5}{2}$ into the original equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4{x}^{2}-20x-15 \\\\  & =-4{(-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}-20(-\\frac{5}{2})-15 \\\\  & =-25+50-15 \\\\  & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is at $(-\\frac{5}{2},10).$",
        "problem_field_keys": [
          "field-1",
          "field-2"
        ],
        "answer_fields_complete": true,
        "result": "Correct",
        "html": "<div id=\"question-222090\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">3.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/704#14836\">Finding the Vertex of a Parabola</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"222090\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\">What are the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><div class=\"freeResponseLine\">The coordinates of the vertex are\n<mjx-cont