        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "For y=ax^2+bx+c, the axis of symmetry is x=-b/(2a). Thus 4=-3/(2k), so 8k=-3 and k=-3/8, choice d. No captured Math Academy answer or grade establishes its stated key.",
          "confidence": 1,
          "answers": [
