        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "The vertex has x=-b/(2a)=20/(-8)=-5/2. Substituting gives y=-4(25/4)+50-15=10. Thus the vertex is (-5/2,10). No captured Math Academy answer or grade establishes its stated key.",
          "confidence": 1,
