        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "The vertex has x=-b/(2a)=-36/(-12)=3. Substituting gives y=-6(9)+36(3)-50=4. Thus the vertex is (3,4). No captured Math Academy answer or grade establishes its stated key.",
